usage: python3 -m valkey_scale_lab.cli [-h] [--version] <command> ...

Valkey scale lab CLI. P00 exposes the command contract; later phases implement
runtime behavior.

positional arguments:
  <command>
    config    Validate and emit run configuration artifacts.
    plan      Create a deterministic cluster plan.
    gate      Run gate lifecycle scenarios.
    fault     Apply and clear sandboxed faults.
    analyze   Analyze machine-readable artifacts.
    report    Render reports from artifacts.
    resource  Resource checks for scale rungs.
    run       Create and inspect run-oriented artifact directories.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --version   show program's version number and exit
